# Project Grand Tourer Advanced - the native PC port of Gran Turismo 6 (BCES01893, 1.22).
# Everything is ignored unless it is named below: a working folder also holds the game's own data and code (game\,
# the lifted code in recompiled\ and spu_*\), builds, saves, mods and logs, and none of that may ever reach the
# repository. Only the port's own source is let in.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitmodules
!/README.md
!/BUILD.md
!/LICENSE
!/CMakeLists.txt
!/game.path
!/app.rc
!/app.ico
!/*.cpp
!/*.c
!/*.h
!/*.inc
!/build_launcher.bat
!/build_release.bat

# the engine: upstream ps3recomp as a submodule; this project's changes to it are patches/00*.patch
!/ps3recomp
!/patches/

!/launcher/
!/tools/
!/trainer/
!/tests/
!/package/
!/third_party/
/third_party/*
!/third_party/imgui/

# Inside the folders that are let in: no builds, no caches, nothing made from the game, nothing that needs keys.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
bin/
obj/
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.lib
*.obj
*.elf
*.ELF
*.sprx
*.prx
*.pkg
*.PUP
*.iso
cars.json
parts_index.txt
/tools/ps3/
/trainer/publish/
